description=Adds Thai translations for the parts, protection/armor tiers, and UI text added by Standardized Vehicle Upgrades 3 (Vanilla + Core) and its dependency tsarslib. Phase 1: item names and in-game UI/part labels (the most commonly seen text). Sandbox option labels, recipe names, context menus, and item tooltips are planned for a later update. Add-on only -- does not modify the original mods, just adds Thai text alongside their existing English.
